	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(467.0, 813.0, 447.0, 92.0)" font-family="Sans Serif" font-size="16">If you configure the Scatter Plot with petal length and petal width, you will see that the Setosa species is completely isolated from the others.</text>
		<text id="1" type="text/plain" rect="(460.0, 369.0, 394.0, 80.0)" font-family="Sans Serif" font-size="16">When we switch to the Heart Disease dataset (Age vs. Cholesterol), the "line" disappears.
</text>
	</annotations>
